OL,3,GNEWSACream tea party for hospice breaks
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospice has broken a world record for
OL,7,Fthe largest cream tea party.
OL,9,FCornwall Hospice brought 2,483 people
OL,10,Ftogether in the attempt to break the
OL,11,Frecord previously held by Mercedes-Benz
OL,12,Fin Beijing with 1,088 attendees.
OL,14,FThe event at the Royal Cornwall
OL,15,FShowground on Saturday was hosted by
OL,16,Fentertainer Johnny Cowling who said:
OL,17,F"This is what Cornwall is all about -
OL,18,Fsupporting one another."
OL,20,FThe charity said the record attempt
OL,21,Falso marked its 45th year of supporting
OL,22,Fpeople across the Duchy.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
